<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS4" title="In IV Experiments and Analysis ‣ NL2GenSym: Natural Language to Generative Symbolic Rules for SOAR Cognitive Architecture via Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-D</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Ablation Study</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS5" title="In IV Experiments and Analysis ‣ NL2GenSym: Natural Language to Generative Symbolic Rules for SOAR Cognitive Architecture via Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">IV-E</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Representative Case Studies</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
